       <script>HistoryPage.mount('#app');</script>

   Real build (data from FastAPI instead of the mock):
       const page = HistoryPage.mount('#app', {
         demoControls: false,
         fetchRecord:   () => API.call('/records/history'),
         requestAccess: () => API.requestAccess('view_history'),
         sendChat:      (t) => API.chat(t),
